#: ../../tools/re3data_tools.rst:61 4f3c0429934543908520481b437603f6
msgid "**Name**: ``re3data_search_repositories``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/re3data_tools.rst:63 c78caf13bd894cfd85dc48e293d054a6
msgid ""
"**Description**: Search re3data.org for research data repositories "
"worldwide. re3data is a global registry of 3,000+ research data "
"repositories covering all academic disciplines. Search by keyword to find"
" repositories that host datasets for a specific research topic, data "
"type, or discipline. Returns repository names, IDs, and DOIs. Use "
"re3data\\_get\\_repository with the returned ID for detailed metadata "
"including subjects, access conditions, content types, and institutional "
"affiliations. Useful for finding where to deposit research data, "
"discovering domain-specific data repositories, or identifying "
"repositories hosting longitudinal, clinical, or cohort study data."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/re3data_tools.rst:67 e9a28519688049c1829bcb888d5c9715
msgid ""
"``query`` (string) (required) Search keyword(s) to find repositories "
"(e.g., 'nutrition longitudinal', 'genomics', 'climate data', 'medical "
"imaging'). Searches across repository names, descriptions, subjects, and "
"keywords."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/re3data_tools.rst:70 2696576932f54267a80045fe8704666e
msgid ""
"``subjects`` (string, null) (optional) Optional subject filter to narrow "
"results (e.g., 'medicine', 'biology', 'chemistry', 'social sciences'). "
"Applied as client-side filter on repository names."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/re3data_tools.rst:73 c626fe9047b64e5694ee32ff61cccced
msgid ""
"``countries`` (string, null) (optional) Optional country filter using ISO"
" 3166 country code (e.g., 'USA', 'GBR', 'DEU'). Note: requires fetching "
"detail for each result so use sparingly."
msgstr ""

